{"id":"665677","name":"洋葱炒肉片","author":"polaris滴食记","authorId":"10301589","desc":"","cover":"images/665677/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"洋葱","amount":"2个"},{"name":"猪肉片","amount":"150克"}],"sub":[{"name":"菜籽油","amount":"10毫升"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"清水","amount":"200毫升"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"炒锅内倒入10毫升菜籽油。","img":"images/665677/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入洋葱丝。","img":"images/665677/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煸炒至断生。","img":"images/665677/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入1勺生抽。","img":"images/665677/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入200毫升清水。","img":"images/665677/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上锅盖炖煮5分钟，让洋葱丝变软变透明。","img":"images/665677/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"打开锅盖，倒入提前腌制好的猪肉片，盖上锅盖焖煮5分钟。","img":"images/665677/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"打开锅盖，翻炒均匀即可关火出锅。","img":"images/665677/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665677/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665677/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}